data: {"id": "7088d9eaeeb24b8a-thinking-parallel_evidence-918", "run_id": "7088d9eaeeb24b8a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论（实体：aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh）\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份确认**：namespace=`aiops-case-05`，pod UID=`546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`，nodeName=`node2`，单容器 `app`（image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`）。\n\n2. **当前状态**：phase=`Pending`，containerStatus reason=`ContainerCreating`，restarts=0，未启动。\n\n3. **Events 核心信息**：\n   - Repeated `Warning: NoNetworkFound` from `multus` agent，持续至少 70 分钟（最新事件距今 60m）。\n   - Warning: `FailedCreatePodSandBox` from `kubelet`。\n   - 错误原文", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789061928707, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

